QuickJS
https://bellard.org/quickjs/ (https://github.com/bellard/quickjs)
MIT
========================================================================

internal/v8bench/microbench.js is QuickJS's tests/microbench.js, unchanged,
with its copyright and license notice in its header. A few of its test
functions are quoted in tests (internal/jit/verify/phimoves_test.go, and
tests in internal/vm that name microbench.js), and
internal/v8bench/microbench_extra.js is written in its form.

go-quickjs began as a reimplementation of QuickJS-NG
(https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs), QuickJS's fork, and keeps its
name and its qjs command; none of its code is derived from QuickJS's or
QuickJS-NG's.

