fdlibm
SunPro (Sun Microsystems' notice)
========================================================================

internal/fdlibm/fdlibm.go, which computes Math's functions, is a port of
fdlibm by way of V8's src/base/ieee754.cc. The notices are in
internal/fdlibm/LICENSE.

========================================================================
Arm Optimized Routines
https://github.com/ARM-software/optimized-routines
MIT
========================================================================

internal/fdlibm/pow.go and powdata.go are a port of its double-precision
pow (math/pow.c, math/pow_log_data.c, math/exp_data.c). The notice is in
internal/fdlibm/LICENSE.

========================================================================
V8
https://v8.dev (https://chromium.googlesource.com/v8/v8)
BSD-3-Clause
========================================================================

From V8 come:

  - internal/fdlibm/fdlibm.go, as above (its notice in
    internal/fdlibm/LICENSE);
  - the WebAssembly decoder's and validator's checks, their order and
    their error messages (wasm/internal/decoder), from
    src/wasm/module-decoder-impl.h and function-body-decoder-impl.h;
  - the opcode tables, wasm/internal/opcode/tables.go, generated from
    src/wasm/wasm-opcodes.h;
  - the texts of error messages: the WebAssembly traps
    (wasm/internal/engine), the WebAssembly namespace's errors
    (wasm/wasmjs), and Intl's and Temporal's errors (internal/vm), from
    src/common/message-template.h, src/wasm/wasm-js.cc and V8's Intl and
    Temporal code.

The license is in wasm/internal/decoder/V8_LICENSE.

