The Go programming language
https://go.dev
BSD-3-Clause
========================================================================

scaledDecimal and shortPowers in internal/jsnum/short.go are derived from
the Eisel-Lemire implementation in Go's strconv package (eisel_lemire.go).
The short-key string hash in internal/vm/builtins_map.go follows the
runtime's memhashFallback. The license is in internal/jsnum/GO_LICENSE.

