Node.js
https://nodejs.org (https://github.com/nodejs/node)
MIT
========================================================================

The path module's script in stdlib/path.go is a port of Node.js's
lib/path.js. The node modules in stdlib and cmd/qjs give Node's error codes
and messages. The license is in stdlib/NODE_LICENSE.

========================================================================
Unicode Character Database
https://www.unicode.org/ucd/
Unicode-3.0
========================================================================

internal/ucd/tables.go (identifiers, spaces, case mappings and foldings)
and internal/regexp/unicodetables.go (the property escapes' sets) are
generated by internal/regexp/internal/unicodegen from the Unicode
Character Database's UnicodeData.txt, CaseFolding.txt and
SpecialCasing.txt, and from test262's generated property-escape tests,
whose sets are the database's. The Unicode License v3 is in
internal/ucd/UNICODE_LICENSE and internal/regexp/UNICODE_LICENSE.

