========================================================================
Dependencies
========================================================================

The module's dependencies are not part of this repository, and their
licenses are in their modules; a binary built from it, such as qjs,
contains them:

  - github.com/go-quickjs/go-intl, Unicode-3.0, whose data is generated
    from CLDR, the Unicode Character Database and ICU's data, as its
    LICENSE says;
  - golang.org/x/sys and golang.org/x/term, BSD-3-Clause;
  - the Go standard library, BSD-3-Clause.

The modules of tools that are not part of the engine have their own:
internal/jit/verify (golang.org/x/arch, BSD-3-Clause),
internal/cmd/v8bench/goja (github.com/dop251/goja, MIT) and
internal/cmd/wasmbench/wazero (github.com/tetratelabs/wazero, Apache-2.0).
